Olsen et al. identified 10 specific intervals in this massive 450,000-year record

20:40.240 --> 20:43.520
where the inter-hemispheric monsoon dipole failed.

20:44.220 --> 20:49.100
10 periods where the monsoons departed from their strict opposition and moved together.

20:49.520 --> 20:51.180
Here's where it gets really interesting.

