36:09.080 --> 36:14.000
It is the massive east-west overturning of the tropical atmosphere over the Pacific Ocean.

36:14.900 --> 36:20.140
Under normal conditions, air rises vigorously over the very warm western Pacific pool near Indonesia,

36:20.840 --> 36:22.760
travels eastward high in the atmosphere,

36:23.000 --> 36:26.900
